<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The directory (I4 step 7a; ADR-0013 §10): the building's one panel, opened at the elevator and with M or Select in
		free roam. Three tabs: "Piani" (the plan's floors in the elevator's order; a floor opens its hall and its rooms),
		"Preferiti e recenti" (the catalog's favourites, then its most recently played games; a game opens its card, the
		quick catalog's card with Avvia and "Mostra nella stanza") and, since I4b step 6, "Modifiche" (the explicit
		actions on the world: "Modifica stanza", "Rigenera stanza / piano / mondo", "Annulla ultima modifica", each of
		which opens its preview, regenerate_preview.rml).
		Bound to the data model "directory" of rv::ui::DirectoryScreen (src/ui/src/directory_screen.cpp), which also names
		the ids below: keep them in step (src/ui/include/rv/ui/directory_model.hpp, tests/unit/ui/test_directory.cpp).
		Every string is written here: the screen binds data and keys only (the floors by their building.json id, the rooms
		by their kind and their systems' names), and an empty field reads "n.d." (non disponibile). The card's readiness,
		blocker and room sentences are the quick catalog's (quick_catalog.rml), and
		its outcome sentences the world card's (game_card.rml), line for line: the test compares them. The focus is the
		model's (DirectoryModel): the screen focuses the tab, row or button it names; the input stays with the
		application, a click selects a row or presses a button. The rows' bindings sit one level below their data-for
		element, as in the quick catalog.
		A row's lines put the short facts first (the counts, the date), the long names last. A one-line text sits straight
		in the paragraph that clips it, one text per paragraph (variants as sibling paragraphs): RmlUi ends a line in an
		ellipsis only for a text whose parent clips it, measured from the parent's left edge. A shared room's systems
		wrap instead: every section's system shows.
	-->
	<title>Indice dell'edificio</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="directory.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="hint_bar.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="directory">
	<div id="directory" class="panel">
		<div class="panel-header">
			<h1 id="dir-title">Indice dell'edificio</h1>
			<span class="count" data-if="tab == 'floors' && floorCount == 1">1 piano</span>
			<span class="count" data-if="tab == 'floors' && floorCount != 1">{{ floorCount }} piani</span>
			<span class="count" data-if="tab == 'games' && gamesState == 'ready' && gameCount == 1">1 gioco</span>
			<span class="count" data-if="tab == 'games' && gamesState == 'ready' && gameCount != 1">{{ gameCount }} giochi</span>
		</div>
		<!-- The tabs: Up past a list's first row reaches them, Left and Right switch, Down returns (the shoulders switch
		     from the lists). -->
		<div id="dir-tabs">
			<button id="dir-tab-floors" class="tab" data-class-active="tab == 'floors'" data-event-click="tab('floors')">Piani</button>
			<button id="dir-tab-games" class="tab" data-class-active="tab == 'games'" data-event-click="tab('games')">Preferiti e recenti</button>
			<button id="dir-tab-changes" class="tab" data-class-active="tab == 'changes'" data-event-click="tab('changes')">Modifiche</button>
		</div>
		<!-- The rooms' header: the floor whose rooms are listed. -->
		<div id="dir-floor-header" data-if="view == 'rooms'">
			<span class="badge"><span data-if="shown.order == 0">T</span><span data-if="shown.order != 0">{{ shown.order }}</span></span>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'ground'">Piano terra</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen2'">Prime console</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen3'">Console a 8 bit</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen4'">Console a 16 bit</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen5'">Console a 32 e 64 bit</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen6'">Sesta generazione</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'gen7'">Console moderne</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'handheld'">Console portatili</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="shown.id == 'computer'">Computer e altro</p>
			<p class="header-title" data-if="!shown.known">Piano {{ shown.id }}</p>
		</div>
		<!-- I4b step 3 (ADR-0015 §4): "Modifica stanza", above the floors while the walker is in a room the editor can
		     edit; Up from the first floor reaches it, Activate enters the editor there. -->
		<div id="dir-edit-room" class="row edit" data-if="editShown" data-event-click="edit()">
			<span class="badge edit-badge"><span class="edit-shelf"></span><span class="edit-shelf"></span><span class="edit-shelf"></span></span>
			<div class="row-text">
				<p class="row-title">Modifica stanza</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'console' && editNumber == 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi di {{ editTitle }}</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'console' && editNumber > 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi di {{ editTitle }} {{ editNumber }}</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'shared' && editNumber == 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi della sala condivisa</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'shared' && editNumber > 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi della sala condivisa {{ editNumber }}</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'arcade' && editNumber == 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi della sala giochi arcade</p>
				<p class="row-meta" data-if="editKind == 'arcade' && editNumber > 1">Sposta, scambia e fissa giochi e arredi della sala giochi arcade {{ editNumber }}</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="dir-list">
			<!-- Piani: the floors, the walker's marked. -->
			<div class="rows" data-if="view == 'floors'">
				<p class="empty" data-if="floorCount == 0">I piani compaiono appena l'edificio è pronto.</p>
				<div class="slot" data-for="floor : floors">
					<div class="row floor" data-attr-id="floor.elementId" data-event-click="row(floor.index)">
						<span class="badge"><span data-if="floor.order == 0">T</span><span data-if="floor.order != 0">{{ floor.order }}</span></span>
						<div class="row-text">
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'ground'">Piano terra</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen2'">Prime console</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen3'">Console a 8 bit</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen4'">Console a 16 bit</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen5'">Console a 32 e 64 bit</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen6'">Sesta generazione</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'gen7'">Console moderne</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'handheld'">Console portatili</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="floor.id == 'computer'">Computer e altro</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="!floor.known">Piano {{ floor.id }}</p>
							<!-- The counts always show; what the floor holds ends in an ellipsis. -->
							<div class="row-meta split">
								<span class="meta-lead"><span data-if="floor.rooms == 1">1 stanza</span><span data-if="floor.rooms != 1">{{ floor.rooms }} stanze</span><span class="dot">·</span><span data-if="floor.games == 1">1 gioco</span><span data-if="floor.games != 1">{{ floor.games }} giochi</span><span class="dot" data-if="floor.known">·</span></span>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'ground'">Atrio e sala giochi</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen2'">1ª e 2ª generazione</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen3'">3ª generazione</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen4'">4ª generazione</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen5'">5ª generazione</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen6'">Console a 128 bit</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'gen7'">Dalla 7ª generazione in poi</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'handheld'">Di ogni generazione</p>
								<p class="meta-rest" data-if="floor.id == 'computer'">Computer, motori di gioco e altro</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<span class="here" data-if="floor.current">Sei qui</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<!-- A floor: its hall with the elevator (row 0, which rides to the floor), then its rooms. -->
			<div class="rows" data-if="view == 'rooms'">
				<div id="dir-room-0" class="row hall" data-event-click="row(0)">
					<!-- The elevator's doors (the bundled fonts have no arrow). -->
					<span class="badge"><span class="door"></span><span class="door"></span></span>
					<div class="row-text">
						<p class="row-title">Corridoio e ascensore</p>
						<p class="row-meta" data-if="shown.current">Torna all'ascensore di questo piano</p>
						<p class="row-meta" data-if="!shown.current">Scendi a questo piano dall'ascensore</p>
					</div>
					<span class="here" data-if="hallCurrent">Sei qui</span>
				</div>
				<!-- I4b step 8 (ADR-0015 §7): a chain's rooms (a room past its capacity and its expansions) stand together, the
				     head first, each expansion indented under it with its number; each room of a chain says which titles it
				     holds, the initials of its first and last in the chain's alphabetical order ("A – K"), section by
				     section in a shared room; titles an update added out of their order (they go after their predecessor
				     wherever it stands) make the ranges overlap: the row says so, and "Rigenera stanza" orders them again. -->
				<div class="slot" data-for="room : rooms">
					<div class="row room" data-class-expansion="room.chainIndex > 1" data-attr-id="room.elementId" data-event-click="row(room.index)">
						<span class="badge room-badge">{{ room.index }}</span>
						<div class="row-text">
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && room.chainIndex == 1">{{ room.title }}</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && room.chainIndex > 1">{{ room.title }} {{ room.chainIndex }}</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'shared' && room.chainIndex == 1">Sala condivisa</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'shared' && room.chainIndex > 1">Sala condivisa {{ room.chainIndex }}</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'arcade' && room.chainIndex == 1">Sala giochi arcade</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="room.kind == 'arcade' && room.chainIndex > 1">Sala giochi arcade {{ room.chainIndex }}</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && !room.chained && room.games == 0">nessun gioco esposto</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && !room.chained && room.games == 1">1 gioco</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && !room.chained && room.games > 1">{{ room.games }} giochi</p>
							<!-- A console room of a chain: its count, then its titles' range. -->
							<p class="row-meta wrap" data-if="room.kind == 'console' && room.chained"><span data-if="room.games == 0">nessun gioco esposto</span><span data-if="room.games == 1">1 gioco</span><span data-if="room.games > 1">{{ room.games }} giochi</span><span data-for="range : room.ranges"><span class="dot">·</span><span class="range">{{ range.first }} – {{ range.last }}</span></span><span data-if="room.scattered"><span class="dot">·</span>in ordine sparso</span></p>
							<!-- A shared or arcade room: its count, then every section's system, on as many lines as they take; in
							     a chain, the sections it holds titles of, each with its range. -->
							<p class="row-meta wrap" data-if="room.kind != 'console' && (!room.chained || room.ranges.size == 0)"><span data-if="room.games == 0">nessun gioco esposto</span><span data-if="room.games == 1">1 gioco</span><span data-if="room.games > 1">{{ room.games }} giochi</span><span class="dot" data-if="room.systems.size > 0">·</span><span data-for="system, i : room.systems"><span data-if="i > 0">, </span>{{ system }}</span></p>
							<p class="row-meta wrap" data-if="room.kind != 'console' && room.chained && room.ranges.size > 0"><span data-if="room.games == 1">1 gioco</span><span data-if="room.games > 1">{{ room.games }} giochi</span><span class="dot">·</span><span data-for="range, i : room.ranges"><span data-if="i > 0">, </span>{{ range.system }} <span class="range">{{ range.first }} – {{ range.last }}</span></span><span data-if="room.scattered"><span class="dot">·</span>in ordine sparso</span></p>
						</div>
						<span class="here" data-if="room.current">Sei qui</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<!-- I4b step 6, Modifiche (ADR-0015 §5, §6): the explicit actions on the world. A row that does nothing now (no
			     room holds the walker) says why, dimmed. Each opens its preview before anything is written. -->
			<div class="rows" data-if="view == 'changes'">
				<div class="slot" data-for="action : actions">
					<div class="row action-row" data-attr-id="action.elementId" data-class-disabled="!action.enabled" data-event-click="row(action.index)">
						<span class="badge glyph" data-if="action.action == 'edit-room'"><span class="edit-shelf"></span><span class="edit-shelf"></span><span class="edit-shelf"></span></span>
						<span class="badge glyph" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room'"><span class="cell big"></span></span>
						<span class="badge glyph rows-1" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor'"><span class="cells"><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span></span></span>
						<span class="badge glyph rows-2" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-world'"><span class="cells"><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span></span><span class="cells"><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span><span class="cell"></span></span></span>
						<span class="badge glyph" data-if="action.action == 'undo'"><span class="chevron"></span></span>
						<div class="row-text">
							<p class="row-title" data-if="action.action == 'edit-room'">Modifica stanza</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'edit-room'">Sposta e fissa giochi e arredi</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room'">Rigenera stanza</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && !action.enabled">Entra in una stanza per rigenerarla</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'console' && !actionRoomChain">Riallestisce {{ actionRoomTitle }}</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'console' && actionRoomChain">Riallestisce tutte le stanze di {{ actionRoomTitle }}</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'shared' && !actionRoomChain">Riallestisce la sala condivisa</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'shared' && actionRoomChain">Riallestisce tutte le stanze della sala condivisa</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'arcade' && !actionRoomChain">Riallestisce la sala giochi arcade</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-room' && action.enabled && actionRoomKind == 'arcade' && actionRoomChain">Riallestisce tutte le stanze della sala giochi arcade</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor'">Rigenera piano</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && !action.enabled">Disponibile fuori dall'ascensore</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'ground'">Riallestisce Piano terra</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen2'">Riallestisce Prime console</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen3'">Riallestisce Console a 8 bit</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen4'">Riallestisce Console a 16 bit</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen5'">Riallestisce Console a 32 e 64 bit</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen6'">Riallestisce Sesta generazione</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'gen7'">Riallestisce Console moderne</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'handheld'">Riallestisce Console portatili</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && actionFloor == 'computer'">Riallestisce Computer e altro</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-floor' && action.enabled && !actionFloorKnown">Riallestisce il piano {{ actionFloor }}</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-world'">Rigenera mondo</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'regenerate-world'">Riallestisce tutto l'edificio</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="action.action == 'undo'">Annulla ultima modifica</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="action.action == 'undo'">Torna a prima dell'ultima modifica</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<!-- Preferiti e recenti: the favourites first, then the most recently played; beside the card, the game
			     chosen stays marked. -->
			<div class="rows" data-if="view == 'games' || view == 'card'">
				<p class="empty" data-if="gamesState == 'loading' && gameCount == 0">Lettura dei preferiti e dei giochi recenti dal catalogo...</p>
				<p class="empty" data-if="gamesState == 'failed'">Il catalogo non si legge: preferiti e giochi recenti non sono disponibili.</p>
				<p class="empty" data-if="gamesState == 'ready' && gameCount == 0">Nessun preferito e nessun gioco avviato di recente: qui compaiono i preferiti di ES-DE e i giochi avviati.</p>
				<div class="slot" data-if="gamesState != 'failed'" data-for="game : games">
					<div class="row game" data-attr-id="game.elementId" data-class-chosen="game.chosen" data-event-click="row(game.index)">
						<div class="row-text">
							<p class="row-title" data-if="game.title != ''">{{ game.title }}</p>
							<p class="row-title" data-if="game.title == ''">Gioco senza titolo</p>
							<!-- The date first: a long system name ends in an ellipsis. -->
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="game.played != ''">Giocato il {{ game.played }} · {{ game.systemName }}</p>
							<p class="row-meta" data-if="game.played == ''">{{ game.systemName }}</p>
						</div>
						<span class="favorite" data-if="game.favorite">Preferito</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p id="dir-notice" class="notice" data-if="notice == 'ride-unavailable'">Ora non si può cambiare piano: riprova tra poco.</p>
		<p class="notice" data-if="notice == 'building-pending'">L'edificio si sta aggiornando: piani e stanze cambiano appena è pronto.</p>
		<p class="notice" data-if="notice == 'change-unavailable'">Ora non si può: l'edificio si sta aggiornando o un'altra modifica è in corso. Riprova tra poco.</p>
	</div>

	<!-- A game's card (the quick catalog's, with Avvia and "Mostra nella stanza"), beside the list. -->
	<div id="dir-card" class="panel" data-if="view == 'card'">
		<h2 id="dir-card-title"><span data-if="card.title != ''">{{ card.title }}</span><span data-if="card.title == ''">Gioco senza titolo</span></h2>
		<p class="subtitle"><span data-if="card.platform != ''">{{ card.platform }}</span><span data-if="card.platform == ''">n.d.</span>, <span data-if="card.year != ''">{{ card.year }}</span><span data-if="card.year == ''">n.d.</span></p>
		<p class="note" data-if="!card.details">Lettura dei dettagli dal catalogo...</p>
		<!-- The quick catalog's lines (quick_catalog.rml), unchanged: the readiness as a one-line label, then a sentence
		     for its first blocker's code. -->
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == '' && card.state == 'unavailable'">Non disponibile: il file del gioco non si trova</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == '' && card.state == 'needs-configuration'">Da configurare: l'emulatore non è impostato</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == '' && card.state == 'emulator-missing'">Emulatore non trovato</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == 'source-unavailable'">Non disponibile: cartella non raggiungibile</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == 'rom-missing'">Non disponibile: file del gioco assente</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == 'requires-configuration'">Da configurare</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == 'emulator-not-found'">Emulatore non trovato</p>
		<p class="state" data-if="card.readiness == 'core-not-found'">Core dell'emulatore non trovato</p>
		<p class="ready" data-if="card.readiness == 'ready' && !card.verified">Pronto</p>
		<p class="ready" data-if="card.readiness == 'ready' && card.verified">Pronto: già avviato e tornato senza errori</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'source-unavailable'">La cartella del sistema o del gioco non è raggiungibile: controlla che il disco sia collegato.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'rom-missing'">Il file del gioco non c'è più: forse è stato spostato o cancellato.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'rom-folder-unresolved'">La cartella dei giochi del sistema non è definita: controlla ROMDirectory in ES-DE.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'rom-root-unknown'">La cartella principale dei giochi (ROMDirectory) non è nota.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'system-unknown' || card.blocker == 'system-not-configured'">ES-DE non configura più questo sistema.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'library-unreadable'">La configurazione di ES-DE non si legge: controlla che ES-DE sia dove library.json lo indica.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'no-command'">Il sistema non ha nessun comando di avvio.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'choice-stale'">Il comando scelto non esiste più: scegline un altro in Emulatori, nel menu.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'profile-unknown'">Il profilo d'emulatore scelto non esiste più: scegline un altro in Emulatori, nel menu.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'profile-template'">Il profilo dell'emulatore contiene argomenti scritti male.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'profile-variable-missing'">Il profilo dell'emulatore usa una variabile che non ha un valore.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'profile-invalid-request' || card.blocker == 'invalid-request'">Windows non può avviare l'emulatore così com'è configurato.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'program-not-allowed'">Il comando non avvia un emulatore che Retroverse sappia trovare: serve un profilo d'emulatore.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'program-refused'">Il comando avvia un interprete di comandi o un programma di avvio, che Retroverse non esegue mai.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'program-repeated'">Il comando indica più di un emulatore.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'program-missing'">Il comando non indica l'emulatore in modo leggibile.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'install-unknown'">La cartella di ES-DE non è nota: indicala con "retroverse-cli library create --install".</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'token-unsupported'">Il comando usa una funzione di ES-DE che Retroverse non esegue.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'token-malformed'">Il comando contiene un segnaposto scritto male.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'command-placeholder'">Il comando di questo sistema è solo un segnaposto: va configurato in ES-DE.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'inject-file'">ES-DE aggiungerebbe argomenti presi da un file del gioco: scegli un altro comando o un profilo.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'start-folder-missing'">La cartella di lavoro indicata dal comando non esiste.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'start-folder-repeated'">Il comando indica più di una cartella di lavoro.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'start-folder-glued'">Il comando indica la cartella di lavoro dentro un altro argomento.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'start-folder-relative'">La cartella di lavoro indicata dal comando non è un percorso completo.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'find-rules-missing'">Le regole di ricerca di ES-DE non dicono dove cercare l'emulatore o il core.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'find-rule-undecided'">Una regola di ricerca di ES-DE dipende da un programma sostitutivo, che Retroverse non usa.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'emulator-not-found'">L'emulatore non si trova in nessuno dei posti dove ES-DE lo cerca.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'core-not-found'">Il core richiesto dal comando non si trova.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'core-malformed'">Il comando indica il core in modo non leggibile.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'core-repeated'">Il comando indica più di un core.</p>
		<!-- I11 step 13: ES-DE's "open the game's file", opened by Retroverse itself. -->
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'file-not-opened'">Il comando apre il file del gioco, ma questo file non è una scorciatoia, un programma o un collegamento Internet: scegli un altro comando per questo sistema.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'shortcut-unreadable'">La scorciatoia o il collegamento del gioco non si può leggere.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'shortcut-target'">La scorciatoia del gioco non apre un programma.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'batch-file'">Il gioco si avvia con un file batch, che Retroverse non esegue mai.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.blocker == 'protocol-not-listed'">Il collegamento del gioco apre un indirizzo che Retroverse non attiva: il suo schema non è tra i protocolli di emulators.json.</p>
		<!-- The last launch from the card, when it did not end normally (the world card's lines, game_card.rml). -->
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'not-ready'">Il gioco non è pronto: la scheda dice perché.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'quick-exit'">Il programma si è chiuso subito: se il gioco è ancora aperto, il profilo deve attendere i suoi processi.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'processes-remained'">Il programma si è chiuso, ma il gioco potrebbe essere ancora aperto.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'left-running'">L'emulatore è rimasto aperto.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'crashed'">L'emulatore si è chiuso per un errore.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'failed-to-start'">L'emulatore non è partito.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'not-configured'">Il gioco non si può avviare così com'è configurato.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'emulator-missing'">L'emulatore non si trova.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'core-missing'">Il core dell'emulatore non si trova.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome == 'rom-missing'">Il file del gioco non si trova.</p>
		<p class="blocker" data-if="card.outcome != '' && card.outcomeKnown == false">L'avvio non è andato a buon fine.</p>
		<div class="info-rows" data-if="card.details">
			<div class="info"><span class="key">Sviluppatore</span><span class="value"><span data-if="card.developer != ''">{{ card.developer }}</span><span data-if="card.developer == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
			<div class="info"><span class="key">Genere</span><span class="value"><span data-if="card.genre != ''">{{ card.genre }}</span><span data-if="card.genre == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
			<div class="info"><span class="key">Giocatori</span><span class="value"><span data-if="card.players != ''">{{ card.players }}</span><span data-if="card.players == ''">n.d.</span></span></div>
			<div class="info" data-if="card.otherVersions == 1"><span class="key">Altre versioni</span><span class="value">1 nel catalogo</span></div>
			<div class="info" data-if="card.otherVersions > 1"><span class="key">Altre versioni</span><span class="value">{{ card.otherVersions }} nel catalogo</span></div>
		</div>
		<div id="dir-card-actions">
			<button id="dir-card-play" class="action primary" data-event-click="card('play')">Avvia</button>
			<button id="dir-card-room" class="action" data-if="card.room == 'placed'" data-event-click="card('room')">Mostra nella stanza</button>
			<button id="dir-card-back" class="action" data-event-click="card('back')">Indietro</button>
		</div>
		<!-- Why the game is not in its room (the quick catalog's sentences, rv/ui/quick_catalog_room.hpp's keys), but for
		     a game the plan does not hold: in the building that is a system without a room (excluded, or no placeable
		     title yet), not another system's room. -->
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'duplicate-title'">Non esposto: un'altra versione è sullo scaffale</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'no-cover'">Non esposto: senza copertina</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'unavailable'">Non esposto: il file del gioco mancava quando la stanza è stata allestita</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'capacity'">Non esposto: la stanza è piena</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'room-kept'">Non esposto: la stanza resta com'era finché non viene generata di nuovo</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'not-in-room'">Non esposto: l'edificio non ha una stanza per il suo sistema</p>
		<p class="room-reason" data-if="card.room == 'other-room'">Esposto altrove nell'edificio</p>
	</div>

	<div id="dir-hints">
		<div class="hint-bar">
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'floors' && !editFocused"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Apri il piano</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="editFocused"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Modifica stanza</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'rooms'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Vai</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'games'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Apri la scheda</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'card'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Conferma</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'changes'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Scegli</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view != 'card'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_filter_previous ui_filter_next"></span>Cambia elenco</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'floors' || view == 'games' || view == 'changes'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_back"></span>Chiudi</span>
			<span class="hint" data-if="view == 'rooms' || view == 'card'"><span class="pad" hint-action="ui_back"></span>Indietro</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
